          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the case involves Richlin Security Service Co. seeking attorney fees under the Equal Access to Justice Act (EAJA)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fde073e9851ff52b11e6a152caa6f43cb4dfa0b79593252e2697764a33dc2467",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fde073e9851f-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the Federal Circuit affirmed the award of attorney fees but denied an award for paralegal services, holding that EAJA does not cover paralegal work."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "MR. YANG",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fde073e9851ff52b11e6a152caa6f43cb4dfa0b79593252e2697764a33dc2467",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fde073e9851f-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The EAJA fee cap has been present since the statute\u2019s inception."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "MR. YANG",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fde073e9851ff52b11e6a152caa6f43cb4dfa0b79593252e2697764a33dc2467",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fde073e9851f-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The theory presented was that attorney fees should be based on prevailing market rates, which could include certain costs."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fde073e9851ff52b11e6a152caa6f43cb4dfa0b79593252e2697764a33dc2467",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fde073e9851f-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The respondent was represented by Anthony Yang in oral argument."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Wolfman",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fde073e9851ff52b11e6a152caa6f43cb4dfa0b79593252e2697764a33dc2467",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fde073e9851f-0003-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 56,
              "start": 56
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Wolfman, the legislative history includes an extensive House report but no Senate report."
      }
